              {
                "title": "A support coach in your pocket",
                "description": "Meet Mindy, your AI-powered recovery coach. Mindy provides personalised guidance, offering insights and strategies tailored to your emotional and physical recovery needs—helping you navigate the path to healing, one step at a time.",
